#. module: tuqui
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tuqui.field_tuqui_oauth_client__read_only
msgid ""
"Default ON. When enabled, the per-member path of /tuqui/rpc refuses every "
"mutating call (create, write, unlink, copy and arbitrary method execution); "
"only reads pass. Reads still run with the acting user's own Odoo "
"permissions. NOTE: the connection (workspace-level) path always runs as "
"superuser and is ALWAYS read-only regardless of this flag. The hardcoded "
"escape-hatch and private-method blocks apply regardless of this flag."
msgstr ""

